      "writtenOn": "2018-07-05T23:19:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do *NOT* use ENUM types. If we ever have to expand it, the only solution is to migrate to a new table and expand the dataset (no-downtime upgrades/rolling upgrades -- the old app will error on the new ENUM type).\n\nEnforce the types strictly in code/business logic and ignore rows with an invalid enum type.\n\nAlso expand on what \"context\" type vs \"user\" type is.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 67,
        "endChar": 72
      },
      "revId": "c9626e53db05e4c6ec671649a2f83a3d228b7056",
